WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:08.750
One of the things you're really well know
for is the TV series Merlin, isn't it?

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.010
Yeah, yeah.
I don't really think I'm ... I think Colin

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.340
Farrell's famous, I think just a few people
know who I am, but everyone's really sweet,

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:19.279
and everyone's like you know .. and it's nice
when people actually like something you do,

00:00:19.279 --> 00:00:20.020
and it's nice that people kind of er .. like
with Merlin .. people genuinely adore the

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:26.359
show and adore the stories of it, and that's
really important, and that's nice, when you

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:31.029
can actually do something and .. and you know
it make's people happy, and you know that's

00:00:31.029 --> 00:00:34.290
the whole point of doing it, people like what
you do and you kind of go yeah!

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:38.690
Merlin's been going on for the last 8 months,
I'm knackered!

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:41.960
What have you been doing in that time?
Riding horses, having sword fights, getting

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:48.960
lost in forests, getting really drunk .. yeah
yeah, well in character!

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:51.930
And have you been enjoying as much as you
enjoyed all the other series?

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:55.199
Yeah, because have you watched it? It's good
fun, have you? Yeah! You know everyone's really

00:00:55.199 --> 00:00:58.979
fucking cool. It's all very chilled, they're
all really nice people to work with, Bradley,

00:00:58.979 --> 00:01:00.780
Colin and Tom, and it's a really nice group
of people, it's the way it should be, it's fun!

